  "description": "FUVDOT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H80 Cl6 Cu2 Gd4 N6 O28,2(C1 H4 O1),4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.415-4.025 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.50-113.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C92H80Cl6Cu2Gd4N6O28·4(C2H3N)·2(CH4O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
